        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12401685/comment/12620239",
          "id": "12620239",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=stefan%40jira",
            "name": "stefan@jira",
            "key": "stefan@jira",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Stefan Guggisberg",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "i don't consider this a 'major' issue.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=stefan%40jira",
            "name": "stefan@jira",
            "key": "stefan@jira",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Stefan Guggisberg",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2008-08-06T12:58:08.951+0000",
          "updated": "2008-08-06T12:58:08.951+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12401685/comment/12620255",
          "id": "12620255",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=schans",
            "name": "schans",
            "key": "schans",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Bart van der Schans",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Amsterdam"
          },
          "body": "I agree it's not major, it is probably the default that i forgot to change.\n\nFrom 6.4.4:\n\n..amounts to the following: a space becomes _x0020_, a tab becomes _x0009_, a \ncarriage return becomes _x000D_, a line feed becomes _x000A_ and \nany underscore (_) that occurs as the first character of a sequence \nthat could be misinterpreted as an escape sequence becomes \n_x005f_. \n\nSo only replacing _x0020_ with spaces isn't enough. The import must at least handle the _x005f_ to avoid the misinterpretation. \n\nI'll try to come up with a patch which also makes sure the export is encoded accordingly.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=schans",
            "name": "schans",
            "key": "schans",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Bart van der Schans",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Amsterdam"
          },
          "created": "2008-08-06T13:59:49.391+0000",
          "updated": "2008-08-06T13:59:49.391+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12401685/comment/12627941",
          "id": "12627941",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
            "key": "jukkaz",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
            },
            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "I turned off the decodeBlanks option in revision 691550. We don't encode blanks when exporting, so there's no point in trying to (even incorrectly) decode them when importing.\n\nResolving as Fixed.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
            "key": "jukkaz",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
            },
            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2008-09-03T09:18:36.692+0000",
          "updated": "2008-09-03T09:18:36.692+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12401685/comment/12630993",
          "id": "12630993",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
            "key": "jukkaz",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
